1
00:00:00,734 --> 00:00:02,734
Okay. Uh, let me ask you this.

2
00:00:03,111 --> 00:00:05,111
(Sheldon:)When I learn that I'm a robot...

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:09,030
(Sheldon:)...would I be bound by
Asimov's Three Laws of Robotics?

4
00:00:09,451 --> 00:00:13,451
(Raj:)You might be bound by them right now.

5
00:00:16,249 --> 00:00:17,249
(Howard:)That's true.

6
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:21,877
- Have you ever harmed a human being?
- Of course not.

7
00:00:22,047 --> 00:00:25,257
(Howard:)Have you ever harmed yourself,
except in cases where a human being...

8
00:00:25,425 --> 00:00:27,095
(Howard:)...would have been endangered?

9
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,760
(Sheldon:)- Well, no.
- I smell robot.

10
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:37,353
- Hey, what's going on?
- Internet's been down for half an hour.

11
00:00:39,648 --> 00:00:41,228
(Raj:)Also, Sheldon may be a robot.

12
00:00:43,276 --> 00:00:45,866
So how did it go with Leslie?

13
00:00:46,029 --> 00:00:50,369
(Leonard:)Oh, we tried kissing,
but the Earth didn't move.

14
00:00:50,534 --> 00:00:54,954
(Leonard:)I mean, any more than the 383 miles
that it was gonna move anyway.

15
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)Oh, I've seen that look before.

